      "number": 9,
      "file": "09-trainability.qmd",
      "anchor": "ch-trainability",
      "title": "Trainability and mechanisms of fitting",
      "introduction": "Energy dissipation leads to fitting only when the relevant trainability is sustained. Linear and affine benchmarks, finite optimization, a global nonlinear family, protected geometry, confinement and fitting-distance boundaries are collected here with their scopes kept separate.",
