      "number": 10,
      "file": "10-correlated-pairs.qmd",
      "anchor": "ch-correlated-pairs",
      "title": "Global fitting of correlated input pairs",
      "introduction": "Label structure and input geometry support complete nonlinear-learning guarantees for the proved pair families. Equal-label, separated-offset and sech-gate results remain individually scoped while sharing one chapter-level comparison.",
      "chunks": [
        "special-data-limits.qmd@__start__",
