      "file": "12-three-sample-learning.qmd",
      "anchor": "ch-three-sample-learning",
      "title": "Three-sample learning and activation design",
      "introduction": "The three-sample constructions reveal how activation design sustains learning across the proved depth regimes. The bounded-shape and large-gain families are presented together so that their mechanisms and restrictions can be compared.",
